100,113],"is_walkin":false},{"title":"Junior Agentic AI Engineer","company":"Commerce Pundit","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-09-03","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-junior-agentic-ai-engineer-commerce-pundit-ahmedabad-2-to-3-years-030926501341","experience":"2-3 Yrs","skills":[16],"is_walkin":false},{"title":"Engineer II - Quality Engg & AI","company":"Anblicks Solutions","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-09-04","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-engineer-ii-quality-engg-ai-anblicks-ahmedabad-4-to-9-years-040926502855","experience":"4-9 Yrs","skills":[6],"is_walkin":false},{"title":"AI Engineer [Fresher]","company":"Addweb Solution","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-09-07","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-ai-engineer-fresher-addweb-solution-pvt-ltd-ahmedabad-0-to-2-years-070926503092","experience":"0-2 Yrs","skills":[1,2,25,26,27,28],"is_walkin":false,"description":"Experience with machine learning,deep learning,NLP,and computer vision. Proficiency in Python,Java,and R. Strong knowledge of AI frameworks such as TensorFlow or PyTorch. .\n\nKey Skills: algorithms,gaming,data analysis,business systems,ai frameworks,ai solutions,ai,machine learning"},{"title":"Sr Electrical Engineer ( Primary)","company":"Mott Macdonald","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-09-07","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-sr-electrical-engineer-primary-mott-macdonald-ahmedabad-6-to-11-years-070926502809","experience":"6-11 Yrs","skills":[44],"is_walkin":false,"description":"Apply broad practical knowledge to design of Layouts - Equipment Layouts for outdoor switchyard,indoor substation,trench / tray layouts,lighting,earthing and lightning protection layouts (Should be able to guide / provide inputs to technicians and review from a technical / quality perspective). \n\nExperience with Utility companies based in US / UK/Europe / Middle east will be preferred\n\nKey Skills: electrical engineer,electrical systems,dg sets,electrical design,cad,electrical engineering,autocad,bess"},{"title":"AI Engineer - Laravel & AI Driven (Work from Office - Ahmedabad)","company":"Stella Technologies","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-09-08","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-ai-engineer-laravel-ai-driven-work-from-office-ahmedabad-stella-technologies-ahmedabad-3-to-6-years-080926015710","experience":"3-6 Yrs","skills":[1,2,3,4,6,9,12,14,15,16,17,19,20,24,25,27,34],"is_walkin":false,"description":"Job Title: AI Software Engineer Laravel & AI-Driven Development (AIDLC) Experience Level: 36 years | Location/Type: Permanent About the Role We're looking for an AI Software Engineer who blends strong backend engineering (PHP/Laravel) with two complementary AI skill sets: 1. Building AI-powered products \u2014 integrating LLMs, Generative AI, RAG, and AI agents into real applications. 2. Practicing AI-Driven Development (AIDLC) \u2014 using AI coding assistants and automation (e.g., GitHub Copilot, Cursor, Claude Code, ChatGPT) throughout the development lifecycle to design, code, test, review, and document software faster and more reliably. This isn't just \"an AI engineer\" or \"a Laravel developer\" \u2014 it's someone who ships production Laravel applications and uses AI tools as a core part of how they work, while also building AI capabilities into the product itself. You'll work closely with product, engineering, and operations teams to design, develop, integrate, and maintain intelligent software solutions \u2014 end to end. Key Responsibilities AI Product Development Design, develop, and deploy AI-powered applications and features. Integrate OpenAI, LLMs, Generative AI models, and third-party AI APIs into business applications. Build AI agents, chatbots, automation workflows, and intelligent assistants. Work with prompt engineering, RAG, embeddings, vector databases, and AI pipelines. Evaluate and optimize AI models for accuracy, performance, reliability, and cost. AI-Driven Development (AIDLC) \n Use AI coding assistants (e.g., Copilot, Cursor, Claude Code, ChatGPT) to accelerate design, coding, refactoring, and documentation. Apply AI-assisted code review, test generation, and debugging to improve code quality and delivery speed. Build and refine internal prompts/workflows that make AI-assisted development safer, faster, and more consistent across the team. Balance AI-generated output with sound engineering judgment \u2014 reviewing, validating, and owning everything that ships. Backend Engineering Develop and maintain scalable backend applications using PHP and Laravel. Build and integrate REST APIs and third-party services. Design efficient data models, queries, and database schemas. Write clean, reusable, well-documented, and testable code. Troubleshoot, debug, and optimize existing applications. Collaboration Translate business requirements into technical solutions with product, engineering, and ops stakeholders. Stay current on Generative AI, LLMs, AI agents, AIDLC tooling, and software development practices. Required Technical Skills Programming Languages PHP / Laravel (strong, hands-on) Python JavaScript / TypeScript SQL HTML5 / CSS3 Advantage: Node.js, Java, or C#/.NET AI-Driven Development (AIDLC) Practical daily experience using AI coding tools (Copilot, Cursor, Claude Code, ChatGPT, or similar) for coding, refactoring, testing, or documentation Ability to critically evaluate AI-generated code rather than accept it at face value \n Experience defining or improving AI-assisted engineering workflows/practices within a team AI / Machine Learning Generative AI and Large Language Models (LLMs) OpenAI or similar AI APIs Prompt engineering RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) Embeddings and vector databases AI agents / agentic AI Chatbot development ML and NLP fundamentals Model/API integration and evaluation Backend & Development REST API development and integration Microservices/API-based architecture Database design and optimization (MySQL/PostgreSQL or similar) Git/GitHub/GitLab Authentication and authorization Debugging and performance optimization Cloud & DevOps AWS / Azure / Google Cloud Docker CI/CD pipelines Linux Cloud-based AI/API deployments Good to Have \n AI agent frameworks OpenAI Assistants/API, Anthropic, Gemini, or similar LLM platforms FastAPI or Flask Node.js Experience building SaaS or enterprise applications Knowledge of AI security, data privacy, and responsible AI practices \n Experience deploying AI solutions to production Experience establishing or documenting AIDLC standards/playbooks for a team Qualifications Bachelor's degree in Computer Science, IT, AI, or related field (or equivalent practical experience). 3\u20136 years of professional software development experience, including relevant AI/ML or Generative AI work. Demonstrable, hands-on use of AI-assisted development tools in real projects (not just casual/occasional use). Strong programming and problem-solving skills; solid grasp of SDLC and coding best practices. Comfortable working independently and collaboratively in a fast-paced environment.\n\nKey Skills: generative ai,PHP Laravel,Machine Learning,CI CD Pipeline,MySQL,Postgresql,Cursor,SQL"},{"title":"Sr AI Engineer","company":"Relay Human Cloud","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-09-08","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-sr-ai-engineer-relay-human-cloud-india-pvt-ltd-ahmedabad-4-to-9-years-080926502829","experience":"4-9 Yrs","is_walkin":false,"description":"The provided JD does not specify a required educational degree \n\nWe are seeking a Senior AI Engineer with a strong software engineering background and hands-on experience building and supporting production-grade AI / GenAI applications\n\nKey Skills: embeddings,data pipelines,ai,automated testing,backend development,application development,ai engineer,automation"},{"title":"Sr AI Engineer (RAG & AWS Bedrock)","company":"UST","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-09-08","url":"https://ww